# Breakfast Tacos

Based on [https://www.loveandlemons.com/breakfast-tacos](https://www.loveandlemons.com/breakfast-tacos) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251226043300/https://www.loveandlemons.com/breakfast-tacos/))

{ rating="4" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

Per Two Tacos

- [ ] 2 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] 1/4 [Avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, sliced
- [ ] 2 [tortillas]{ ing="tortillas" }
- [ ] (Optional) [Cheese]{ ing="cheese" }, shredded
- [ ] 1/2 cup [Pico de Gallo]{ ing="pico-de-gallo" }, Salsa, Diced Tomatoes, etc.
- [ ] [Cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }
- [ ] [Hot sauce]{ ing="hot-sauce" }

## Recipe

1. In either a skillet or microwave (30s + 10s as needed), cook the [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
1. Heat the [tortillas]{ ing="tortillas" } (can also be done in microwave between two plates)
1. Serve with choice of toppings
